    "limitations": [
      "Default routes are Invocation to Mechaba, Branded to Lubellion, and Lubellion to Mirrorjade. Additional explicitly registered exact two-card Invocation recipes use own hand only. Substitutes, tokens, facedown field materials, Xyz/Pendulum materials, attachments, redirects and unreviewed departure triggers are excluded.",
